    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always wanted to feel like an '80s action hero? Take down a global terrorist organization?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/95d34ff7c82d7c11330c238576c36de3.poster.avif?t=1755046140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/95d34ff7c82d7c11330c238576c36de3.webm?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/95d34ff7c82d7c11330c238576c36de3.mp4?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Random Generated Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassinate officers, free hostages, blow stuff up - complete a variety of dynamic objectives. No handholding, but easy to pick up! Every playthrough brings a fresh challenge with diverse terrains and layouts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring Total Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unload an arsenal of high-powered weapons, raining bullets and explosions on everything in sight. Make it personal!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Missions Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer stealth or full-frontal chaos, tackle objectives in your own style.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/87adda66097ad1e118b3ecf7eea3960e.poster.avif?t=1755046140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/87adda66097ad1e118b3ecf7eea3960e.webm?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/87adda66097ad1e118b3ecf7eea3960e.mp4?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to Expect?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranger Commando is a small game for quick, replayable fun - no complex progression or roguelike mechanics to worry about. A campaign consists of 10 missions played in various locations around the world. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical gameplay, with light stealth mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for a quick, stress-relieving session after a long day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is less than 8 minutes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Solo dev project, please be gentle \ud83d\ude4f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/1426ce69d02826c73e2e6f082fd8e056.poster.avif?t=1755046140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/1426ce69d02826c73e2e6f082fd8e056.webm?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/1426ce69d02826c73e2e6f082fd8e056.mp4?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About World Peace Industries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a trusted private military contractor and leading weapon manufacturer, World Peace Industries has now become a global threat. Hired to protect nations, it has gone rogue, amassing power and constructing fortified bases worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believing they are the only force capable of maintaining global stability, they will go to any lengths to impose order - no matter the cost. Their actions grow more ruthless with each passing day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to infiltrate, sabotage, and dismantle their growing empire before their grip on the world becomes unbreakable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always wanted to feel like an '80s action hero? Take down a global terrorist organization?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/95d34ff7c82d7c11330c238576c36de3.poster.avif?t=1755046140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/95d34ff7c82d7c11330c238576c36de3.webm?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/95d34ff7c82d7c11330c238576c36de3.mp4?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Random Generated Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassinate officers, free hostages, blow stuff up - complete a variety of dynamic objectives. No handholding, but easy to pick up! Every playthrough brings a fresh challenge with diverse terrains and layouts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring Total Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unload an arsenal of high-powered weapons, raining bullets and explosions on everything in sight. Make it personal!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Missions Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer stealth or full-frontal chaos, tackle objectives in your own style.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/87adda66097ad1e118b3ecf7eea3960e.poster.avif?t=1755046140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/87adda66097ad1e118b3ecf7eea3960e.webm?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/87adda66097ad1e118b3ecf7eea3960e.mp4?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to Expect?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranger Commando is a small game for quick, replayable fun - no complex progression or roguelike mechanics to worry about. A campaign consists of 10 missions played in various locations around the world. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical gameplay, with light stealth mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for a quick, stress-relieving session after a long day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is less than 8 minutes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Solo dev project, please be gentle \ud83d\ude4f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/1426ce69d02826c73e2e6f082fd8e056.poster.avif?t=1755046140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/1426ce69d02826c73e2e6f082fd8e056.webm?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549980/extras/1426ce69d02826c73e2e6f082fd8e056.mp4?t=1755046140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About World Peace Industries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a trusted private military contractor and leading weapon manufacturer, World Peace Industries has now become a global threat. Hired to protect nations, it has gone rogue, amassing power and constructing fortified bases worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believing they are the only force capable of maintaining global stability, they will go to any lengths to impose order - no matter the cost. Their actions grow more ruthless with each passing day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to infiltrate, sabotage, and dismantle their growing empire before their grip on the world becomes unbreakable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
